<title>UK: Middlesex to buy Wolff Steel for 3.8 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Middlesex to buy Wolff Steel for 3.8 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conglomerate Middlesex Holdings Plc said it has agreed to buy Wolff Steel, holding company for a group of steel trading firms, for 3.8 million stg.</p>
<p>Wolff Steel's principal investment is in Afon Tinplate Company Ltd, a venture with British Steel.</p>
<p>Wolff Steel posted a pre-tax profit of 863,000 stg in 1995 compared with 614,000 stg the previous year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
